WEBVTT

00:07:27.797 --> 00:07:30.597
This is the new frontier
for artists and their fans.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.863
And just like in the real world,

00:07:32.897 --> 00:07:36.430
and artist can sell a one-of-a-kind piece,

00:07:36.463 --> 00:07:39.563
make limited editions
to control for scarcity,

00:07:39.563 --> 00:07:42.097
show in art galleries and market places.

00:07:43.297 --> 00:07:45.363
But with NFTs,

00:07:45.363 --> 00:07:50.263
you can also sell directly to your buyer
without an intermediary,

00:07:50.297 --> 00:07:53.897
collect royalties on all future resales,

00:07:53.897 --> 00:07:56.930
expand your audience
to the entire internet,

00:07:56.963 --> 00:08:00.663
show in virtual galleries
and virtual worlds